# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Short links for event signage, QR codes, and saying out loud from the front of a room.
# 302 (not 301) so we can repoint a short link at the next event without fighting
# browser caches. Query strings on the request are carried through, which is how the
# QR code's ?utm_source=devx&utm_medium=qr survives to the signup form.

/devx  /office-hours  302
